---@field filter? string Optional. Filters the results by principal type. Uses the [AIP-160](https://google.aip.dev/160) filter syntax. Only the following filters are supported: * `principal:group_key`: bindings for groups. This is the default when the filter is empty. * `principal:service_account OR principal:service_account_project_number`: bindings for service accounts. * `principal:federated_principal`: bindings for federated principals. Values can be in snake_case or camelCase. Whitespace and the order of `OR` terms don't matter. Any other filter returns an `INVALID_ARGUMENT` error.

---@class gcp.accesscontextmanager_v1.ListPermissionsRequest
