---@field osType? gcp.accesscontextmanager_v1.OsConstraintOsTypeEnum|string Required. The allowed OS type.
---@field requireVerifiedChromeOs? boolean Only allows requests from devices with a verified Chrome OS. Verification includes requirements that the device is enterprise-managed, conforms to domain policies, and the caller has permission to call the API targeted by the request.
---@field minimumVersion? string The minimum allowed OS version. If not set, any version of this OS satisfies the constraint. Format: `"major.minor.patch"`. Examples: `"10.5.301"`, `"9.2.1"`.

