---@class gcp.accesscontextmanager_v1.PatchAccessPoliciesAccessLevelsRequest
---@field title? string Human-readable title. Must be unique within the policy.
---@field custom? gcp.accesscontextmanager_v1.CustomLevel A `CustomLevel` written in the Common Expression Language.
---@field basic? gcp.accesscontextmanager_v1.BasicLevel A `BasicLevel` composed of `Conditions`.
---@field description? string Description of the `AccessLevel` and its use. Does not affect behavior.
---@field updateMask? string Required. Mask to control which fields get updated. Must be non-empty.
